# JSON Compact Formatter — uses the Rust-native $builtin-to-json serializer.
#
# Previously delegated to codecs/json.llt via [include %libdir ...], but the
# include-decomp sprint broke the [include ...] mechanism for CLI output formatters.
# This version uses $builtin-to-json (a Rust-native builtin added to fix the regression).
#
# $builtin-to-json: deep-materializes the value and serializes to compact JSON string.
# Handles: Int, Float, Bool, String, Dict, Seq (via collect), Null ([]).
# Errors on: Function, Builtin, NaN/Infinity floats, unserializable values.
#
# Returns a String (the formatted JSON output). No emit calls.

[call $builtin-to-json %]
